// AUTO-GENERATED — image URLs harvested from the global landing-page
// template seeds (distinctiveTemplates, flagshipTemplates, globalTemplates,
// industryTemplates). These get inserted into lp_media as shared rows
// (tenant_id = NULL, is_shared = true) so every tenant sees them in the
// "Starter" category of the image picker. Regenerate via:
//   pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server exec tsx scripts/regen-starter-images.ts
// (script is intentionally not committed — the URL list is the source of truth).
//
// Content + lp-purpose tags were authored from each image's slot in the
// template seeds (hero/og backgrounds → "lp-hero", gallery/feature/avatar
// slots → "lp-feature", close-up product/object shots → "product-detail";
// content tags mirror the gallery alt text / card titles the templates use)
// so the AI page generator's tag scorer (routes/lp/generate-page.ts) can
// place starter imagery by relevance instead of arbitrarily. The migrate
// seed (starter_images_seed_v2 in migrate.ts) UPSERTS these tags onto
// already-seeded rows; non-seed legacy rows are re-tagged by
// scripts/retag-media-library.ts instead.

